<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan forex market closes for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan forex market closes for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange market was closed on Thursday for the beginning of a five-day Chinese lunar new year holiday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the Taiwan dollar ended at T$27.508 against Tuesday's T$27.438 finish.</p>
<p>Turnover through dealers was a heavy US$317.5 million.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on February 11.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
